{%- comment -%}
  Gold Subscription founding offer - rendered on subscribable gold PDPs (Creatine Monohydrate,
  Creatine Hydration, Colostrum). Markup only: when a customer subscribes, theme.js adds the
  free OLNIAN Gold Subscription Gift (keepsake gold lid + signature pink scoop) through the
  shared cart flow, using the gift variant main-product.liquid puts on the form. An AUTOMATIC
  Buy-X-Get-Y discount makes the gift free at checkout; the 200-unit cap rides on the gift
  product's own inventory (tracked/deny). cart-drawer.liquid removes a gift that no longer
  qualifies for that discount.

  This block is the ONLY place the founding offer is described - the purchase-option note and
  the trust line stay short so the offer isn't repeated three times on one screen.

  Renewal (Loop) orders never touch the storefront cart, so the gift is first-order-only automatically.
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="gold-offer">
  <span class="gold-offer__eyebrow">Founding offer · first 200 members</span>
  <h3 class="gold-offer__title">Join the <em>Gold Subscription</em></h3>
  <p class="gold-offer__body">Your first subscription order ships with the keepsake <strong>gold jar lid</strong> and our <strong>signature pink scoop</strong> — free. <span class="gold-offer__value">A $16.99 gift, yours to keep.</span></p>
  <ul class="gold-offer__points">
    <li>Only 200 gift sets, then the offer closes</li>
    <li>Skip or cancel anytime after your second delivery</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<style>
  .gold-offer {
    margin: 16px 0 20px;
    padding: 18px 20px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    border: 1px solid #E4C878;
    background:
      radial-gradient(120% 140% at 12% 0%, rgba(246,224,178,.55) 0%, rgba(246,224,178,0) 55%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #FFFDF8 0%, #FFF6F4 100%);
  }
  .gold-offer__eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700;
    color: #A87D3B;
  }
  .gold-offer__title {
    margin: 8px 0 6px; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.15; font-weight: 600; color: #241F1B;
  }
  .gold-offer__title em { font-style: italic; color: #C77E9B; } /* pink accent */
  .gold-offer__body { margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #4A423B; }
  .gold-offer__value { color: #A87D3B; font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; }
  .gold-offer__points { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }
  .gold-offer__points li { position: relative; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 13px; color: #4A423B; }
  .gold-offer__points li::before {
    content: "✦"; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; color: #C9A55E; font-size: 12px;
  }
  /* Mobile: keep the offer tight so the Add to Cart button stays close to the price. */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .gold-offer { margin: 12px 0 14px; padding: 14px 16px; border-radius: 14px; }
    .gold-offer__title { font-size: 18px; margin: 6px 0 5px; }
    .gold-offer__body { font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.45; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .gold-offer__points { gap: 5px; }
    .gold-offer__points li { font-size: 12.5px; }
  }
</style>
